<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARIAN O/N RATES STEADY AT 22.625 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARIAN O/N RATES STEADY AT 22.625 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight interest ended unchanged on Tuesday at 22.625 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Rates moved in a narrow range in slow trade,&quot; said Sandor Szatmari of Unicbank.</p>
<p>&quot;It's the early part of the new reserve period when the market is liquid and traders are always more passive than in the second half,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +361 327 4040</p>
</text>
